---
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div>
    <span class="footer-mark">☾</span> {SITE_TITLE}
    <p>愿每一个平凡的夜晚，都有值得留下的文字。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-links">
    <a href={`${base}rss.xml`}>RSS 订阅 ↗</a>
    <a href="#top">回到页首 ↑</a>
    <small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} fhaworld · Built with Astro</small>
  </div>
</footer>
